  "description": "The Seventh Heaven by Lutfah is a sweet, floral-fruity, musky-amber fragrance that feels dreamy, uplifting, and softly luxurious. It opens with bright fruits, soft citrus, and a touch of floral sweetness , giving a clean and elegant first impression. The heart introduces white florals, rose, jasmine, and airy creamy notes , creating a smooth, heavenly softness. The base settles into warm amber, vanilla, soft musk, and delicate woods , leaving a long-lasting, warm, glowing trail that feels comforting and ethereal — truly “heavenly.” Perfect for customers who love sweet, feminine, airy floral scents with a clean musk-amber finish.",
